    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/a1a02ecf9dd7fb221891d265ea7010d1.avif?t=1754770238\" width=616 height=188 /></span><strong>ENLIST TODAY</strong><br>Our galaxy is under threat! Entire colonies have gone dark, and critical research outposts lie abandoned. In response, Earth\u2019s intergalactic military division \u2014 the Lunar Corps \u2014 has deployed a special operations team to investigate and uncover the source of these anomalies.<br><br><strong>LEAD</strong>       <br>Climb the ranks of the Lunar Corps. Lead your squad into the onslaught. Become the leader the Corps needs.        <br>       <br><strong>LIBERATE </strong>     <br> Defend our planets, rescue survivors and bring justice to all those who have fallen.        <br>        <br><strong>SURVIVE   </strong>      <br>Hold the line and break through the hoards to ensure humanities survival.    <br>    <br>    <br>M<strong>ATURE CONTENT</strong><br>This game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or for viewing in the workplace, including frequent violence, gore, and general mature themes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298340/extras/a1a02ecf9dd7fb221891d265ea7010d1.avif?t=1754770238\" width=616 height=188 /></span><strong>ENLIST TODAY</strong><br>Our galaxy is under threat! Entire colonies have gone dark, and critical research outposts lie abandoned. In response, Earth\u2019s intergalactic military division \u2014 the Lunar Corps \u2014 has deployed a special operations team to investigate and uncover the source of these anomalies.<br><br><strong>LEAD</strong>       <br>Climb the ranks of the Lunar Corps. Lead your squad into the onslaught. Become the leader the Corps needs.        <br>       <br><strong>LIBERATE </strong>     <br> Defend our planets, rescue survivors and bring justice to all those who have fallen.        <br>        <br><strong>SURVIVE   </strong>      <br>Hold the line and break through the hoards to ensure humanities survival.    <br>    <br>    <br>M<strong>ATURE CONTENT</strong><br>This game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or for viewing in the workplace, including frequent violence, gore, and general mature themes.</p>",
